{"id":"a8d9726d9ac1a850","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness.md","title":"R归结反驳蕴含无模型","display":"thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness — R归结反驳蕴含无模型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness"],"display":"thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness — R归结反驳蕴含无模型","depends_on":["[[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]]","[[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2–2.6.3 print61–62/PDF73–74; complete local soundness direction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness — R归结反驳蕴含无模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c489124090a894d6\" href=\"?note=c489124090a894d6\" title=\"72-df-r-resolution-derivation\">72-df-r-resolution-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7005c5e9ddc38c06\" href=\"?note=7005c5e9ddc38c06\" title=\"72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness\">72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2–2.6.3 print61–62/PDF73–74; complete local soundness direction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是第一式中任意给定的结论子句。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,D)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,D)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RRef}(\\pi,F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Unsat}_{FO}(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RRef}(\\pi,F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Unsat}_{FO}(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式按有限行号归纳：输入行由F满足，R步由两父归纳假设及局部可靠性得到。空子句对任何赋值都假，且结构域非空，所以不能有满足全部输入的结构，得到第二式。原书的反方向还使用Herbrand定理、统一子存在及提升引理；当前节点只声明并证明可靠性方向，没有借两个方向的书中标题压缩那些额外义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-r-resolution-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"c489124090a894d6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7005c5e9ddc38c06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RDer}(\\pi,F,D)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}F\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}D.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RRef}(\\pi,F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Unsat}_{FO}(F).","display":true}],"bytes":1704,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compa